@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title L2：Kafka 单 Topic、多分区消费

participant KafkaConsumerWorker as Worker
participant KafkaConsumer
queue KafkaBroker
participant CoreListener

Worker -> KafkaConsumer: subscribe([one physical topic])
loop while running
  Worker -> KafkaConsumer: poll(pollTimeout)
  KafkaConsumer -> KafkaBroker: fetch assigned partitions
  KafkaBroker --> KafkaConsumer: records(P0, P1, ...)
  KafkaConsumer --> Worker: ConsumerRecords

  loop each TopicPartition
    loop records in current partition by offset
      Worker -> CoreListener: onMessage(inbound)
      alt SUCCESS
        CoreListener --> Worker: SUCCESS
        Worker -> KafkaConsumer: commitSync(partition, offset + 1)
      else RETRY / exception
        CoreListener --> Worker: RETRY
        Worker -> KafkaConsumer: seek(partition, failed offset)
        Worker -> Worker: consumerRetryBackoff
        note right of Worker
          停止当前分区后续记录，
          继续处理本轮其他分区。
        end note
      end
    end
  end
end

note over Worker
当前一个 ConsumerDefinition 对应一个 Topic、一个 Worker、一个 poll 线程。
注册多个订阅可并发消费多个 Topic；单个 Worker 内分区暂不并行。
end note
@enduml
